with a projector screen]\n[S28T1] (dia_id: D28:1)\n\nDave: Congrats on your album release and the party, Calvin! Must've been a great feeling having your loved ones show their support.\n[S28T2] (dia_id: D28:2)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! It was an awesome feeling seeing everyone come together to celebrate - super rewarding! Look at this photo showcasing how wonderfully we spent our time!\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of people dancing at a party]\n[S28T3] (dia_id: D28:3)\n\nDave: Wow, great job, Calvin! Congrats! What was it like when everyone was cheering you on?\n[S28T4] (dia_id: D28:4)\n\nCalvin: It was incredible, Dave! The room was buzzing with energy and love. It was a powerful reminder of why I'm doing this.\n[Image caption: a photo of a group of people standing on top of a stage]\n[S28T5] (dia_id: D28:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Creating something that brings people together and inspires them - that's really awesome!\n[S28T6] (dia_id: D28:6)","text_sha256":"efb6c52f78c9be07eb4095cbb6ba753596edf4cfdb5f2a841edfbca34bbad3c1","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D8:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S8T1]"],"text_sha256":"f57977b13730cd3fe15a47cfe3f8970a3f6621fa68ffb288b00d39c4d9c2470f"},{"dia_ids":["D8:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":17,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S8T2]"],"text_sha256":"eef0e75e7346a422793144ef52e1a50cb60de7890d52efa011a97a2606a42429"},{"dia_ids":["D8:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":21,"line_start":19,"source_locators":["[S8T3]"],"text_sha256":"cea925a109268e3f72a097ae22c4a5d679bcf3bb9546c4d534349894ed852e09"},{"dia_ids":["D8:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":24,"line_start":23,"source_locators":["[S8T4]"],"text_sha256":"2521a9c8b8cd2ffc14061a3f971ea457be3c59f50cc711376679d950bf8c1c4b"},{"dia_ids":["D8:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":28,"line_start":26,"source_locat